<title>USA: NY Public Utilities Commission to meet Tuesday.</title>
<headline>NY Public Utilities Commission to meet Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Public Utilities Commission said it will meet Tuesday at 1000 EDT/0400 GMT at its officers in Albany.</p>
<p>The meeting had been scheduled for Wednesday, it noted.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
